;; db: bench_er
;; Triangle detection on a random ER graph.  The binary pipeline enumerates
;; all 2-paths (a->b->c) then checks (a,c); a semijoin filter can only prune
;; drivers whose `a` has no out-edge, so on a connected ER graph this test
;; measures pure filter OVERHEAD (expected pruning: none).
table (edge int int)
table (tri int int int)

rule (edge A B) (edge B C) (edge A C) --> (tri A B C)
